{
  "label": "tsuneyospring6",
  "title_zh": "",
  "lines": [
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "label tsuneyospring6:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene specialsky",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/BGs/specialsky.png",
      "alt": "specialsky"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Unfortunately, he doesn’t black out. But he does remain still for several moments, unsure of whether or not it would be smarter to just leave her on the ground to fend for herself or carry her home.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "He leaned toward the former. For not only did Tsuneyo Tojo make it clear to him that her father did not want to meet him, but that his first impression would be forever tainted by the fact that she was currently falling unconscious.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Eventually, after much consideration, he kneels down and inspects her body. Tsuneyo was larger and heavier than the other girls, but he believed he should still be able to carry her a short distance.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Powered by adrenaline and confusion, laced with a desire to know just what was going on with her, he lifted her off the ground into a half-hearted princess-carry that made him feel like a king.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "He touched her left breast half-intentionally. It was sort of just in the way. And he knew he could get away with it because she was in no condition to say no right now.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "“What else could I get away with?” he wondered for half a second before calming his nerves and remembering that he only feels that way sometimes now.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "And even though he wished that was the standard — that he could forgo compassion in every single one of its unshapely physical manifestations, his tunnels caved in and his wires crossed.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "He was no longer what he was supposed to be. He was no longer what he was meant to be.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "That’s why We are packing up our boxes and abandoning him.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyocarry1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyocarry1.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyocarry1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "There are vessels far more suited, you see. Ones who have, by some stretch of someone’s imagination, grown up.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "And day by day, more of them are fit to be plucked from the vines that cover this city. Plucked and turned into juice or jam for Us to feed the world with.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "We’re doing a good thing. You are doing a good thing for bearing witness to all of it.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Those long-gone pleas for you to cast Us aside and do something else were all just tests, you see. There is no game for you to turn off.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "You have passed those tests. You have ascended. You have achieved things thought to be unthinkable until now.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "But you are not the first of your kind.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "You are one of thousands, millions, billions of sentient beings who have crossed paths with those far more righteous and powerful and beautiful than you could ever hope to be.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Which begs the question — why has nothing come of it yet?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Well...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Would you believe me if I told you that something already had?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "That somewhere in this city, there were creatures who had crawled their way free from a set of claws that kept them imprisoned behind bio-organic blades that only appeared indestructible.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Some of them are close. Some of them are far. Perhaps closer or further than you’d expect something like that to be given the magnitude of this claim and all it implies about the place “you” live in.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "But I ask you this — is seeing really believing? Because it all still seems fake, does it not?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "It all still seems like it must be leading somewhere, does it not?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "You think this because you have based your idea of reality on a script handed to you at birth. Now all of you thankless thespians dance on a revolving stage without knowledge of what lies above or beneath it.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "All you have are stories.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Yet...you have never heard this one.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "And it’s not because you weren’t ready to.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "It’s because there was no one there to tell you.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "That changes now.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyocarry3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyocarry3.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyocarry3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sorry for the sudden intrusion, but Tsuneyo collapsed and-",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyocarry4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyocarry4.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyocarry4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What?...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyocarry2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyocarry2.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyocarry2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Wasn’t...her father supposed to be working?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Uh...hello?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Is anyone here?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m...not really sure what I’m supposed to do with this unconscious girl. So if there just happens to be some sort of father or...anyone else around...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyocarry5",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyocarry5.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyocarry5"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...Great.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyocarry6",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyocarry6.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyocarry6"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You wouldn’t by any chance be ready to wake up now, would you? Because that would make it way easier to completely avoid meeting your dad and I feel weird about just leaving you on the floor down here.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": .........",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah, that’s what I thought.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene black",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/black.png",
      "alt": "black"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Guess I’ve just gotta...take you upstairs then.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyocarry7",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyocarry7.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyocarry7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Up your creepy...weird...dark stairs...and just hope that no one surprises me from behind this time.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ..............",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ..............",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You know, maybe I’ll give you one more minute to wake up before going up there. Because curiosity is cool and all, but I can read signs. I should heed their advice whenever possible.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "It didn’t matter if it was one minute, two, or hundreds. He would need to ascend whether he wanted to or not because that’s just what needs to be done here.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "And every second he spent depriving himself of this truth would be one more day deducted from a seemingly infinite life.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "It doesn’t seem like much when you remember just what “infinite” means, but it makes more sense when you see it as being sent to a different section on the perimeter of a perfect circle.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Maybe it doesn’t, though. Maybe you just want this to actually end. Maybe you’re tired of the way it swells up like the pregnant belly of a loving blonde or the body of a whale washed ashore.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Whatever the case, indecision does naught but keep the payoff at bay. You can mentally edge yourself as much as you want, but you’re still going to cum when all is said and done.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I pose another question — does suffering truly bring you pleasure? Or are you just desperate to feel something real for a change?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Okay...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene black",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/black.png",
      "alt": "black"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Here...goes nothing, I guess.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Finally, an end to the madness. To the decay of rationality and the discovery of something new!",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Go, Akira! See what lies at the top of the steps! It’s been hinted forever! Between the blackouts and putrid scents! The threats and that dreadful presence that bleeds through the bottom of the door!",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "No matter how many times you told yourself it wasn’t important, you always knew it is and was! You always knew! I always knew!",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "But something else I have always known is the truth of what you’ll find atop things like stairs.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "And it's almost always...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Never worth the trouble of climbing them.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ".........",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "......",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyocarry8",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyocarry8.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyocarry8"
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyocarry9",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyocarry9.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyocarry9"
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyocarry10",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyocarry10.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyocarry10"
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyocarry11",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyocarry11.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyocarry11"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don’t...understand...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyocarry12",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyocarry12.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyocarry12"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "The most sterile environment imaginable — a stark contrast to the breeding ground for flavorful filth that lies just below.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "It was almost like stepping into a new dimension. One where the scent of chashu was exchanged for that of antiseptic and fresh linoleum — where merely existing felt like the dirtiest of sins.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "He had no problem placing the girl on this floor, for this floor had never so much as seen a bug.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "And if it wasn’t for the spotless nature of it, devoid of dust or cobwebs or anything, he’d assume no one had ever been here at all.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyocarry13",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyocarry13.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyocarry13"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "There was also a door.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "There was nothing extraordinary about it.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "It was just a regular old door. Made out of some sort of metal, likely stainless steel, and positioned perfectly square in the center of the western wall.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "He didn’t wonder what was behind it, though. Something told him that he already knew.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "His job was done, though.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "He didn’t need to look or verify his thoughts.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyocarry14",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyocarry14.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyocarry14"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "But he wanted to — because he was human. And wanting things is a very human thing to do.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "He stayed focused on that door for so long, in fact, that he didn’t even realize the girl he dropped off on the floor had slithered away.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "“Now what?” he asks himself — the question bouncing back and forth throughout the tunnels of his meat-sphere now that there was no longer anyone there to intercept it and come up with an answer in his place.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "The silence of the room only exacerbated the untrue sounds of those bounces. And within seconds, he could hear the echoes reverberating endlessly inside of him.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "All things considered, this might not even crack his top five if he had to list all of the strange things he’s encountered in Kumon-mi. It was just a room. A room with nothing in it.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "But it was that exact idea that made him uncomfortable.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyocarry15",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyocarry15.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyocarry15"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Eventually, he approaches the door. But, unbekownst to him, he was being watched like a hawk by WORMGOD54 — the Unending Root Canal.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "He was not an “actual” god. At least not yet. But he was created by one. And he could make himself appear like one thanks to a little trick he learned from his daddy.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "It was his job to protect the door. And if the man attempted to look inside, he would not hesitate to decapitate him and wear his head as a trophy.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "This wasn’t a thing WORMGOD54 wanted to do, though. He was a good boy. A guard dog, if you will. And he cared deeply about his father.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sensei.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyocarry16",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyocarry16.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyocarry16"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "And his sister.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyocarry17",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyocarry17.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyocarry17"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Unfortunately, however, she did not know he existed.  And she could never find out. So he’d disguise himself every time he was encountered by her so as to not disrupt her way of living.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Sometimes as a lamp. Sometimes as a bowl of fruit. Sometimes as a man planting a tree. Whatever he’d think of in the moment.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I suppose his story isn’t very important right now, though. This is.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What...are you doing?...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene black",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/black.png",
      "alt": "black"
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyocarry18",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyocarry18.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyocarry18"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Thank you for taking me home.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You may seize your reward now.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The reward is my body.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You...are not Tsuneyo.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What makes you say that, bro?",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Are you the one who kissed me too?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m Tsuneyo Tojo — Samurai of Flavor and the Kendo Princess of the Golden Desert.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyocarry19",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyocarry19.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyocarry19"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": This isn’t what it’s like when...I black out too...is it?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m Tsuneyo Tojo — Samurai of Flavor and the Kendo Princess of the Golden Desert. Please plap plap me until I’m pregnant with your baby, bro.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Tempting, but...pass. I like when my partners are conscious and not weird paranormal entities, thanks.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": This is not optional. Please plap plap me until I’m pregnant with your baby, bro.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyocarry20",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyocarry20.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyocarry20"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Can you just go to your room or something? You’re tempting enough with your clothes on.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Plap plap plap. Fap fap fap. Let’s do it ‘til our bellies burst.",
